lected by default and can be tapped or clicked to apply the suggestion, streamlining input and enhancing usability."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Chips can show multiple interactive elements together in the same area, such as a list of selectable movie times, or a serie of email contacts."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements."}],"title":"MISOSuggestionChip","kind":"symbol"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents":{"images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents","title":"Components","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by MISO. It contains also "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifiers"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views."}],"role":"collection"},"ic_folder_categories.png":{"type":"image","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/MISOComponents\/ic_folder_categories.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","alt":null}}}